{"id": "25222", "title": "混沌的狂诗", "author": "食食物者", "category": "玄幻魔法", "count": 9, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/25/25222.htm", "intro": "主角们的档期总是很忙的。才拯救完地球，又被发配到异界。不过这个过程中猪脚华丽的失忆了，而他的“敌人”就在一旁虎视眈眈。好吧，看来本次的冒险不能全凭经验了。", "base": "files/article/html/25/25222", "chapters": [{"title": "羔羊", "volume": true}, {"title": "倒悬者－－－为未来而战（上）", "file": "1775349.html", "available": false}, {"title": "倒悬者－－－为未来而战（下）", "file": "1775351.html", "available": false}, {"title": "倒悬者－－－引导希望的祭品", "file": "1775365.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三 羔羊（上）", "file": "1775370.html", "available": false}, {"title": "羔羊（下）", "file": "1775373.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四 苏醒、疑惑以及迷梦", "file": "1775375.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五 迷路", "file": "1775379.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六 原来，我才是弱者", "file": "1775382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七 尴尬以及不可思议的恢复力", "file": "1775384.html", "available": false}]}